Well, the main loop is allmain.c in the function moveloop():

http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Allmain.c#Main_loop


But of course, after initialization nothing happens as long as the
player doesn't hit a key.

In cmd.c the array cmdlist contains all the special commands the
player can call by pressing a key.

E.g. the key 'E' calls the function 'doengrave()':
http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Cmd.c#line1392

> So I'm kind of lost, with a lot of files here and there... and now I'm
> asking for a little guidance...

It is a large program, so don't worry if you don't find immediately
what you're looking for.

A good search program helps a lot.

And you can always ask here if you don't understand what the program
does.

> I've been searching through the
> internet but haven't found a lot that may help. Is there a guide to
> the sources? something like the general (or even not so general)
> structure of the code?

There is no complete documentation of the code besides the code
itself.

But on the NetHack wiki, there are some source code files being
annotated:
http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Source_code

That might help a little.

